          "borderColor": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "padding": "0px",
          "margin": "12px 0px"
        },
        "text": "A demonstration of what can be accomplished through CSS-based design. Select any style sheet from th",
        "className": "",
        "id": ""
      },
      {
        "styles": {
          "fontFamily": "\"Libre Baskerville\", sans-serif",
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "fontWeight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "32px",
          "letterSpacing": "normal",
          "fontStyle": "normal",
          "color": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
          "borderColor": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "padding": "0px",
          "margin": "12px 0px 0px"
        },
        "text": "Download the example html file and css file",
        "className": "",
        "id": ""
      },
      {
        "styles": {
          "fontFamily": "\"Libre Baskerville\", sans-serif",
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "fontWeight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "32px",
          "letterSpacing": "normal",
          "fontStyle": "normal",
          "color": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
          "borderColor": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "padding": "0px",
          "margin": "12px 0px"
        },
        "text": "Littering a dark and dreary road lay the past relics of browser-specific tags, incompatible DOMs, br",
        "className": "",
        "id": ""
      },
      {
        "styles": {
          "fontFamily": "\"Libre Baskerville\", sans-serif",
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "fontWeight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "32px",
          "letterSpacing": "normal",
          "fontStyle": "normal",
          "color": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
          "borderColor": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "padding": "0px",
          "margin": "12px 0px"
        },
        "text": "We must clear the mind of the past. Web enlightenment has been achieved thanks to the tireless effor",
        "className": "",
        "id": ""
      },
      {
        "styles": {
          "fontFamily": "\"Libre Baskerville\", sans-serif",
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "fontWeight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "32px",
          "letterSpacing": "normal",
          "fontStyle": "normal",
          "color": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
          "borderColor": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "padding": "0px",
          "margin": "12px 0px 0px"
        },
        "text": "The CSS Zen Garden invites you to relax and meditate on the important lessons of the masters. Begin ",
        "className": "",
        "id": ""
      },
      {
        "styles": {
          "fontFamily": "\"Libre Baskerville\", sans-serif",
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "fontWeight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "32px",
          "letterSpacing": "normal",
          "fontStyle": "normal",
          "color": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
          "borderColor": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "padding": "0px",
          "margin": "12px 0px"
        },
        "text": "There is a continuing need to show the power of CSS. The Zen Garden aims to excite, inspire, and enc",
        "className": "",
        "id": ""
      },
      {
        "styles": {
          "fontFamily": "\"Libre Baskerville\", sans-serif",
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "fontWeight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "32px",
          "letterSpacing": "normal",
          "fontStyle": "normal",
          "color": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
          "borderColor": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "padding": "0px",
          "margin": "12px 0px 0px"
        },
        "text": "CSS allows complete and total control over the style of a hypertext document. The only way this can ",
        "className": "",
        "id": ""
      },
      {
        "styles": {
          "fontFamily": "\"Libre Baskerville\", sans-serif",
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "fontWeight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "32px",
          "letterSpacing": "normal",
          "fontStyle": "normal",
          "color": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
          "borderColor": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "padding": "0px",
          "margin": "12px 0px 0px"
        },
        "text": "Strong visual design has always been our focus. You are modifying this page, so strong CSS skills ar",
        "className": "",
        "id": ""
      },
      {
        "styles": {
          "fontFamily": "\"Libre Baskerville\", sans-serif",
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "fontWeight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "32px",
          "letterSpacing": "normal",
          "fontStyle": "normal",
          "color": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
          "borderColor": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "padding": "0px",
          "margin": "12px 0px 0px"
        },
        "text": "You may modify the style sheet in any way you wish, but not the HTML. This may seem daunting at firs",
        "className": "",
        "id": ""
      },
      {
        "styles": {
          "fontFamily": "\"Libre Baskerville\", sans-serif",
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "fontWeight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "32px",
          "letterSpacing": "normal",
          "fontStyle": "normal",
          "color": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
          "borderColor": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "padding": "0px",
          "margin": "12px 0px 0px"
        },
        "text": "Download the sample HTML and CSS to work on a copy locally. Once you have completed your masterpiece",
        "className": "",
        "id": ""
      },
      {
        "styles": {
          "fontFamily": "\"Libre Baskerville\", sans-serif",
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "fontWeight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "32px",
          "letterSpacing": "normal",
          "fontStyle": "normal",
          "color": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
          "borderColor": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "padding": "0px",
          "margin": "12px 0px 0px"
        },
        "text": "Why participate? For recognition, inspiration, and a resource we can all refer to showing people how",
        "className": "",
        "id": ""
      },
      {
        "styles": {
          "fontFamily": "\"Libre Baskerville\", sans-serif",
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "fontWeight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "32px",
          "letterSpacing": "normal",
          "fontStyle": "normal",
          "color": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
          "borderColor": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "padding": "16px 96px 0px 192px",
          "margin": "0px"
        },
        "text": "Where possible, we would like to see mostly CSS 1 & 2 usage. CSS 3 & 4 should be limited to widely-s",
        "className": "",
        "id": ""
      },
      {
        "styles": {
          "fontFamily": "\"Libre Baskerville\", sans-serif",
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "fontWeight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "32px",
          "letterSpacing": "normal",
          "fontStyle": "normal",
          "color": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
          "borderColor": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "padding": "16px 96px 0px 192px",
          "margin": "0px"
        },
        "text": "Luckily, designing this way shows how well various browsers have implemented CSS by now. When sticki",
        "className": "",
        "id": ""
      },
      {
        "styles": {
          "fontFamily": "\"Libre Baskerville\", sans-serif",
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "fontWeight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "32px",
          "letterSpacing": "normal",
          "fontStyle": "normal",
          "color": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
          "borderColor": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "padding": "16px 96px 0px 192px",
          "margin": "0px"
        },
        "text": "We ask that you submit original artwork. Please respect copyright laws. Please keep objectionable ma",
        "className": "",
        "id": ""
      },
      {
        "styles": {
          "fontFamily": "\"Libre Baskerville\", sans-serif",
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "fontWeight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "32px",
          "letterSpacing": "normal",
          "fontStyle": "normal",
          "color": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
          "borderColor": "rgb(50, 80, 80)",
          "padding": "16px 96px 64px 192px",
          "margin": "0px"
        },
        "text": "This is a learning exercise as well as a demonstration. You retain full copyright on your graphics (",
        "className": "",
        "id": ""
      },
      {
        "styles": {
          "fontFamily": "\"Libre Baskerville\", sans-serif",
          "fontSize": "32px",
